Package: dsHPCClient
Type: Package
Title: Observability and Administration for dsHPC
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("David", "Sarrat González", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "david.sarrat@isglobal.org"),
    person("Juan R", "González", role = "aut", email = "juanr.gonzalez@isglobal.org"))
Author: David Sarrat González [aut, cre],
    Juan R González [aut]
Maintainer: David Sarrat González <david.sarrat@isglobal.org>
Description: Client-side R package for disclosure-safe shared tracking,
    results and server-side output reuse for durable dsHPC analyses, with
    capability-scoped compatibility and admin-key-gated operations. Domain
    packages such as dsImagingClient submit validated workflows through the
    dsHPC server API. Analyst Studio displays logical tracking roots only;
    patient-level artifacts, execution jobs, logs and scheduler topology stay
    on the server.
